                "message": "Backfill: make notes with vulpea-create (ID, CREATED), fill from BibTeX, index them\n\nThe backfill went through citar-create-note, so with citar's file source\nthe notes had no ID, no :CREATED:, and no BibTeX metadata, and were not\nin the Vulpea database, so the table in the book note stayed empty.\nIt now makes each note with vulpea-create, fills it from the BibTeX entry\n(given the file explicitly), indexes the file and then refreshes the table.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAsbQDho5VHotsU68a",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "a2356a5f6a915212de4ed03a55cbab5e495a4839",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/siainbuletin/dotfiles/git/trees/a2356a5f6a915212de4ed03a55cbab5e495a4839"
